title: crm-field-trust-gate
abstract: >-
  Companion code for an upcoming article: a field-level trust contract, a gate that
  enforces it before an AI agent writes to a CRM, provenance stamps on agent writes,
  two simulations, and a read-only audit of real CRM exports.
